description: "开发任务工作流强制契约（仅 /workflow-dev 与 /requirement-guardian 会话内必读）—— 先走 workflow intent，编码后 drift check。未调用上述 skill 时不要自动建流。关键词：工作流、需求、迭代、drift、workflow-dev、requirement-guardian。"
alwaysApply: false
